            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige <code>4</code> bis <code>8</code> in der Konsole an, indem du die Anweisung nach <code>counter++</code> platzierst.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"counter &lt; 8\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"83\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wave &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>counter++;</code>, gefolgt von <code>console.log(\"Wave \" + counter);</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
